  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Love Gu tells Ren Zu to choose loyalty because he already has fear. Cognition Gu tells him to choose betrayal because he already has courage. When Ren Zu holds both, loyalty Gu turns into betrayal Gu and betrayal Gu turns into loyalty Gu. The beastman explains that loyalty to others is betrayal to oneself, and betraying others is loyalty to yourself. Self Gu urges him to choose betrayal, saying that walking his own road means betraying others and even himself. Ren Zu chooses betrayal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1175
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "choice",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_love_gu",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "gu_cognition_gu",
          "gu_self_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Before leaving, the beastman warns that with betrayal, Ren Zu cannot go to a place called Care: there, betrayal will harm him, but if he does not Care, betrayal cannot harm him at all.",
        "chapters": [
          1175
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "harm-at-care",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Tribulations strike, Betrayal Gu flies with Weak Gu and fear Gu and urges Ren Zu to run. The three then decide to leave him and fly away; Self Gu bites them as they flee, but they still escape. Rules and Regulation Gu tell Self Gu not to chase them, and say Weak Gu and betrayal Gu cannot help in that moment.",
        "chapters": [
          2052
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "flight-from-tribulations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_weak_gu",
          "gu_rules_and_regulation_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
